      <g data-component-id="shape_1" data-component-type="Text" class="">
        <text x="1" y="11" font-size="0.2916666666666667" fill="#94a3b8" class="cad-text" dominant-baseline="auto"><tspan x="1" dy="0em">Use the bottom toolbar to add Viewports to sheets.</tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em"></tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em">When editing a detail, you can add lines,</tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em">rectangles, and text elements.</tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em"></tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em">Try clicking on the shapes below to edit</tspan><tspan x="1" dy="1.2em">their properties.</tspan></text>
